{"slug":"speed-demon-boss-fight-(real)-Auto-parryhide-namelock-bossorbit-boss-225494","_id":"6a8ddc26813480dd8db8f9c0","title":"Auto parry,hide name,lock boss,orbit boss","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e8c","gameId":13151311229,"name":"[UPD] speed demon boss fight (real)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":13151311229},"features":"1. Auto Parry\n Power Switch (ON/OFF): Toggles the automatic parry system. When enabled, it detects incoming attacks and triggers defense automatically.\n\n Parry Modes (Azure + Ivory / Azure):\n\n Azure + Ivory: Executes a combo parry sequence using both tools.\n \nAzure: Performs the parry using only the Azure periastron\n\n Legit Mode (ON/OFF): Adds a natural human-like reaction delay (ranging from 0.09s to 0.18s) before parrying to make your gameplay look less robotic.\n\n2. Identity Engine\n Name Input: Type any custom name you want to display (Visual its cilent sided to hide ur name when recording\").\n\n Apply Name Button: Activates the identity changer to alter the text and name elements within the game environment.\n\n3. Boss Mechanics\n Boss Lock (ON/OFF): Automatically locks your character's viewpoint and faces you directly toward the nearest boss NPC.\n\n Boss Orbit (ON/OFF): Automatically makes your character circle and orbit around the targeted boss.\n\n Distance Box (m): Sets the radius distance for your orbit around the boss (adjustable up to 20 meters)\n.\n Speed Box: Controls the rotational speed of your orbit (adjustable up to 200).\n Target Status: A real-time text indicator showing the name of the boss currently locked or being tracked.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/5pqnmdHn\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a44137f9bb610b51cfdd38f","username":"VioletvetScripterShy","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6e884283a047db46312f2c94eaae39